      },
      {
        "id": "25",
        "text": "Fluid organic integrity balanced with micro-structural parameters.",
        "type": "heading",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "26",
        "text": "We approach fashion accessories as portable, living fine art pieces. Our signature sculptural silhouettes avoid classical linear geometry constraints, drawing dynamic movement inspiration from shifting desert dunes and raw pottery vessels.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "27",
        "text": "Every piece is carefully shaped from naturally supple grain hides using custom internal canvas framework support matrixes, allowing the contours to remain striking and soft under daily carry load weights.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "28",
        "text": "Design Intelligence",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "29",
