        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "30",
        "text": "How are the sculptural curved profiles balanced?",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "31",
        "text": "Each bag utilizes lightweight internal resin-dipped canvas ribs that preserve the dynamic outer curve without hardening the natural, supple surface drape of the outer leather grain.",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "32",
        "text": "Tell me about the natural dye process.",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "33",
        "text": "Our tanneries employ organic chestnut, oak bark, and mineral earth clay solutions. This natural bath sequence infuses the leather with translucent hue depth that reacts smoothly over time to light exposure.",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "34",
        "text": "What limits are enforced on item runs?",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
      {
        "id": "35",
        "text": "To protect raw material integrity and control global supply chains, our main atelier operates on an exact allocation scheme capping every specialized shape run at 120 numbered units worldwide.",
        "type": "text",
        "customized": false
      },
